i>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>27/10/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <b>28/10/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Last Date :<strong>30/10/2026</strong></li>\n<li>AIBE XXII Exam Date :<strong> 29/11/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>14/11/2026</b></li>\n<li>Tentative Result Date Available : <strong>07 to 10 January 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.4017%;height: 196px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee*</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General (UR) / OBC : <b>3500</b>/-</li>\n<li>SC / ST : <strong>2500/-</strong></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Online / Offline Fee Mode Only</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 66px\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.343%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000\">All India Bar Exam AIBE XXII Notification 2026 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Age Limit Details</span></span> </b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No Age Limit in All India Bar Exam AIBE AIBE XXI 2026</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.343%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Bar Council AIBE 22 Exam 2026</span></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b> : </b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Eligibility Details</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 48.9409%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 54.4017%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"5\"><strong>BAR Council AIBE 22 Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 110px\">\n<td style=\"width: 48.9409%;text-align: center;height: 61px\" colspan=\"3\">All India Bar Examination AIBE XXII</td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.4017%;text-align: center;height: 61px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Bachelor Degree in Law (LLB) in Any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General and OBC Candidate : 45%</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SC / ST / PH : 40%</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 376px\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.343%;height: 376px\" colspan=\"8\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th Matriculation Certificate</li>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate/Diploma Certificate</li>\n<li>Law Degree LLB 3 Years/LLB 5 Years Certificate</li>\n<li>Passport Size Photograph</li>\n<li>Signature photograph</li>\n<li>Enrollment Certificate</li>\n<li>Category Certificate</li>\n<li>Disability Certificate</li>\n<li>All documents have to be uploaded in PDF format whose size should be less than 1 MB.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.343%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full AIBE XXII Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.343%;height: 146px\" colspan=\"8\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 48.9409%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"3\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.4017%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 103.343%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"8\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Apply Onlin