-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q3. Where can I find the syllabus for the All India Bar Examination AIBE XXII Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q4. How can I download the All India Bar Examination AIBE XXII Examination 2026 Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q5. What is the last date to apply online for All India Bar Examination AIBE 22nd Examination 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>27 October 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q6. What is the last date to pay the application fee?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">28 October 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for All India Bar Examination AIBE XXII Examination 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_29663\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-29663\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-29663\" title=\"AIBE 22nd\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-scaled.png\" alt=\"AIBE 22nd\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1492\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-300x175.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-1024x597.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-768x448.png 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-1536x895.png 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AIBE-22nd-2048x1194.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-29663\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">All India Bar Exam AIBE 22nd XXII 2026 Apply Online<span style=\"font-size: 17px\">.</span></figcaption></figure></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
